<div class="grid md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,8fr)_minmax(0,3fr)]">
  <%!-- Left: main content --%>
  <div class="p-3 md:p-6 md:border-r">
    <h1 class="text-h2 md:text-h1">Working the birds? Let the world know!</h1>

    <p class="mt-4">
      Whether you're on a DXpedition, a park activation, or just home in the shack, sometimes it can be hard to
      drum up a scheduled contact on the birds.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4">
      Sign up to post an activation alert when you plan to be on a satellite, and together we can increase the
      utilization of this amazing amateur radio resource.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4">
      This site is <i>not</i> intended to be a replacement for satellite pass prediction software.
      For now, it's just a tool to promote operating activity.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-h2 mt-12">Feedback?</h2>
    <p class="mt-4">
      Send it along to WW1X at <.link href="mailto:hamsat@schrock.me" class="link">hamsat@schrock.me</.link>
    </p>
  </div>

  <%!-- Right: sidebar --%>
  <div class="bg-gray-50 px-3 py-4 md:px-6 md:py-5 flex flex-col gap-6 text-sm border-t md:border-t-0">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
      <div class="text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-400">More from WW1X</div>
      <div>
        <.link href="https://remotehamradio.com/" class="link">Remote Ham Radio</.link>
        <div class="text-[13px] text-gray-500">Get on the air from anywhere</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <.link href="https://morsle.fun/" class="link">Morsle</.link>
        <div class="text-[13px] text-gray-500">The daily Morse code challenge</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <.link href="https://www.ww1x.radio/sotagoat/" class="link">SOTA Goat for iOS</.link>
        <div class="text-[13px] text-gray-500">Essential tool for Summits On The Air chasers and activators</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <.link href="https://ww1x.radio/" class="link">WW1X.radio</.link>
        <div class="text-[13px] text-gray-500">Apps, SOTA, etc.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
      <div class="text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-400">Attribution</div>
      <div class="text-[13px] text-gray-500">
        <.link href="https://leafletjs.com/" class="link">Leaflet</.link>
        map data © <.link href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/" class="link">OpenStreetMap</.link>
        contributors, imagery © <.link href="https://www.mapbox.com/" class="link">Mapbox</.link>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
